Package: causalMed
Title: Parametric G-Formula for Longitudinal Mediation and Total Effects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Alimu", "Dayimu", 
                    email = "alimdayim@hotmail.com", 
                    role = c("aut", "cre")),
             person("Xingling", "Guo", 
                    role = c("aut")))
Description: Causal mediation analysis for longitudinal data with time-varying
    exposures, mediators and confounders, covering both interventional
    (<doi:10.1002/sim.7426>) and natural (<doi:10.1515/jci-2016-0006>) direct
    and indirect effects. Estimation uses the parametric g-formula
    (<doi:10.1016/0270-0255(86)90088-6>), which is also exposed directly so
    that counterfactual means or risks can be estimated under static, dynamic
    or time-varying hypothetical interventions.
